###########################
# T5577 passwords to try on a tag whose own is not known, as Proxmark3 ships them.
#
# One 8 digit hex word per line, a leading # for a comment. Read with keys_dict, the same way
# the NFC key dictionaries are.
#
# Worth knowing before sweeping these: 44 of them have bit 31 set, and a password frame that
# reaches a tag with no password at all is read off the wrong bit positions - where that bit
# lands on block 0's lock bit. So a sweep has to stop at the first word that opens the tag.
